---
title: "withdraw_collateral - Withdraw Collateral from Obligation (Scallop Lend)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_version: check version == current_version
    q_check_version --> q_error_version: version mismatch
    q_error_version --> [*]: abort error
    q_check_version --> q_check_lock: version matches
    q_check_lock --> q_error_locked: obligation locked
    q_error_locked --> [*]: abort 770
    q_check_lock --> q_check_owner: obligation not locked
    q_check_owner --> q_error_owner: obligation_key.obligation_id != obligation.id
    q_error_owner --> [*]: abort 0 (not owner)
    q_check_owner --> q_update_oracle: ownership verified
    q_update_oracle --> q_accrue_interest: fetch x_oracle prices
    q_accrue_interest --> q_calc_collateral: accrue_interest(market, clock)
    q_calc_collateral --> q_calc_debt: collateral_value = sum(collateral_i * price_i * collateral_weight_i)
    q_calc_debt --> q_calc_remaining: debt_value = sum(debt_i * price_i * borrow_weight_i)
    q_calc_remaining --> q_check_health: remaining_collateral = collateral_value - withdraw_value
    q_check_health --> q_error_health: remaining_collateral < debt_value (would be unhealthy)
    q_error_health --> [*]: abort 1795 (withdraw too much)
    q_check_health --> q_withdraw: remaining_collateral >= debt_value
    q_withdraw --> q_update: obligation.collaterals[T] -= withdraw_amount
    q_update --> [*]: emit CollateralWithdrawEvent, return Coin

    note right of q_check_owner
        INV-001: only ObligationKey owner can withdraw collateral
        INV-002: x_oracle price must be updated in same PTB before withdrawal
    end note

    note right of q_check_health
        INV-003: remaining collateral_value >= debt_value after withdrawal
        INV-004: risk_level remains below 100% after withdrawal
    end note
